# Safe to commit: the URL and publishable key are meant to ship in the
# client bundle (EXPO_PUBLIC_ vars are inlined at build time). Row Level
# Security on every table is what actually gates access — see
# supabase/migrations. Never put APEX_API_KEY or any service-role key here.
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://mcjxelzimstpebomjvqk.supabase.co
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=sb_publishable_niLJ3EsK2cZFox7wZr0VUw_FJtZjn8q
# Public half of the VAPID key pair used for web push (Web Push spec
# requires it client-side to subscribe) — safe to ship, same as the
# values above. The private half is a Supabase Edge Function secret
# (VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY), never here.
EXPO_PUBLIC_VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY=BE9M0ll5NZkH7M2fhnqcKwWy4Ibfch17lc2cGD4CF5Fk_Gv3R72gTLmYu2D39h1eYPb2CjA9EAssxIZuwzpbt_U
